questions.prompt:
What is the output of the following program segment?
int x = 4;
if (x > 5)
    x = x * 2;
else
    x = x + 2;

What is the final value of “sum”?
int sum = 0;
for (int i = 1; i <= 4; i++)
    sum = sum + 2*i;

What is the final value of x?
int x = 10;
for (int i = 1; i <= 5; i++)
{
    if (i == 3)
        continue;
    x = x + i;
}

